  <main>
    <section class="hero hero-video"><video class="bgvid" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464822759023-fed622ff2c3b?w=1600&q=60&auto=format&fit=crop"><source src="https://assets.mixkit.co/videos/15919/15919-720.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><div class="veil"></div>
      <div class="wrap hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="timeword"><span class="tw past">Past</span><span class="tw present">Present</span><span class="tw future">Future</span></div>
        <h1>A coach. Every day. <em>For your whole life.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">Every morning you receive one key: a short teaching and one small practice. Russ walks the year with you, chamber by chamber, until your life is in order, past, present and future.</p>
        <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Begin with Russ</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#pricing">See the plans</a></div>
        <p class="guarantee">From $149 a month. Your first week is on us.</p>
        
      </div></div>
      <div class="proof"><div class="wrap proof-grid"><a href="/the-360/"><b>360</b><span>Keys for the mind</span></a><a href="/the-180/"><b>180</b><span>Keys for the body</span></a><a href="/method/"><b>11</b><span>Chambers</span></a><a href="/method/"><b>9</b><span>Gates</span></a><a href="#russ"><b>1</b><span>Coach. For you.</span></a></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="sec gallery-sec faces"><div class="wrap"><p class="strip-head">The whole person</p><div class="gallery"><figure><img src="/img/russ/strip/mind.jpg" alt="Russ teaching at a whiteboard" style="object-position:50% 12%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Mind</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1502086223501-7ea6ecd79368?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Children leaping for a ball in a green forest" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Body</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1609220136736-443140cffec6?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A father carrying his two children" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Heart</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="why"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Why most self-help fails</p><h2>You don't need more books.<br>You need a plan and a person.</h2></div>
      <div class="quiz"><h3>Thirty seconds: which part of your life is loudest right now?</h3><p>Pick one. You'll land on that part of the year, with your first key from it.</p><div class="opts"><a class="brown" href="/as-learned/"><b>The past</b>I keep repeating a pattern and I want to see where it came from.</a><a class="green" href="/as-loved/"><b>The present</b>I know what to do. I need someone in the room when I don't.</a><a class="navy" href="/as-lived/"><b>The future</b>It matters now what I leave, not just what I earn.</a></div></div>
          </div></section>

    <section class="sec gallery-sec"><div class="wrap"><p class="strip-head">Three ways to be coached</p><div class="gallery"><figure><img src="/img/russ/strip/inperson.jpg" alt="Russ reading aloud to a group by a stone fireplace" style="object-position:50% 18%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>In person</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/img/russ/strip/retreat.jpg" alt="A men’s circle gathered in a mountain meadow" style="object-position:50% 60%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>In a circle</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1476234251651-f353703a034d?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A family walking through a field at golden hour" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>As a family</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>

    <section class="sec dark vid-sec" id="russ"><video class="bgvid" autoplay muted loop playsinline><source src="https://assets.mixkit.co/videos/47818/47818-720.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><div class="veil"></div><div class="wrap guide-grid">
      <img src="/russ-michaels.jpg" alt="Russ Michaels" width="340" height="425" loading="lazy" />
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Your coach</p><h2>Russ Michaels</h2><p class="lede">Most coaches sell energy, a system, or a rule. Russ is a practicing attorney and a twenty-year operator who coaches from the whole picture: how you were built, how you are living, and what you intend to leave. Every key you receive was chosen and ordered by him, from a lifetime of learning from the world’s great teachers and traditions.</p><blockquote>Sometimes we meet life where it is, not where we are. We hold that together.</blockquote><div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.vaulthuman.com/writing">Writing</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/russ-michaels/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec coach-sec" id="coaching"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">In the room</p><h2>The work happens face to face.</h2></div>
      <div class="lgrid "><figure class="big"><video  style="--p:10% 50%;--pm:50% 35%" class="fg slow" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/img/russ/v2/home-room-poster.jpg" aria-label="Russ coaching a room from the stage"><source src="/img/russ/v2/home-room.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></figure><figure class=""><img  style="--p:100% 40%;--pm:70% 40%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/v2/home-marianne.jpg" alt="Russ on stage with a microphone beside Marianne Williamson" width="1280" height="846" loading="lazy" /></figure><figure class=""><img  style="--p:50% 30%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/v2/home-burchard.jpg" alt="Russ and Brendon Burchard at High Performance Academy" width="1200" height="869" loading="lazy" /></figure><figure class=""><img style="--p:50% 0%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/v2/home-rohr.jpg" alt="Russ seated beside Father Richard Rohr" width="1018" height="1322" loading="lazy" /></figure><figure class=""><img  style="--p:50% 40%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/v2/home-forest.jpg" alt="A men’s circle gathered in a pine forest" width="1280" height="960" loading="lazy" /></figure><figure class=""><img  style="--p:50% 28%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/v2/home-mic.jpg" alt="Russ speaking with a microphone on a lit stage" width="1035" height="1400" loading="lazy" /></figure></div>
    </div></section>
<style is:global>
  .lgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));grid-auto-rows:230px;gap:14px}
  .lgrid figure{margin:0;position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px;background:#0d0f0d}
  .lgrid .big{grid-column:span 2;grid-row:span 2}
  .lgrid.tall .big{grid-column:span 1}
    .lgrid .fg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:var(--p,50% 50%)}
  @media(max-width:760px){.lgrid .fg{object-position:var(--pm,var(--p,50% 50%))}.lgrid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));grid-auto-rows:170px;gap:10px}.lgrid .big,.lgrid.tall .big{grid-column:span 2;grid-row:span 2}.lgrid:not(.tall) .big{grid-row:span 1}.lgrid:not(.tall) figure:last-child{grid-column:span 2}}
</style>
<script is:inline>document.querySelectorAll(".lgrid video.slow").forEach(function(v){v.playbackRate=0.5;v.addEventListener("loadedmetadata",function(){v.playbackRate=0.5;});});</script>
    <section class="sec alt" id="how"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p><h2>Three steps.</h2><p class="lede">One key a day, one chamber at a time, with a coach who knows your name.</p></div>
      <div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="n">01</div><h3>Begin</h3><p>Choose your plan. Russ writes to welcome you, and your first key arrives the next morning at 7.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">02</div><h3>Meet Russ</h3><p>A 30-minute conversation in your first week to find where you are and where to start.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">03</div><h3>Walk the year</h3><p>One key each morning. Three lines each night. A gate opens each time a practice becomes a habit.</p></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="method"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">The method</p><h2>Keys, chambers, gates.</h2><p class="lede">Every teaching we use is a key: one idea, who first taught it, and one small practice. The keys sit in eleven chambers, from You to Sharing. When a practice holds, the gate to the next chamber opens.</p></div>
      <div class="mgrid"><a class="mcard" href="/the-360/"><b>360</b><h3>Keys for the mind</h3><p>From Og Mandino and William James to the mystics and the modern greats. Day one: read Mandino’s Scroll One aloud.</p><span>See the 360 →</span></a><a class="mcard" href="/the-180/"><b>180</b><h3>Keys for the body</h3><p>Breath, food, strength, sleep and recovery, each traced to its source. Day one: a walk outside.</p><span>See the 180 →</span></a><a class="mcard" href="/method/"><b>11</b><h3>Chambers</h3><p>You · Body · Awareness · Meaning · Healing · Circle · Rhythm · Freedom · Tomorrow · Service · Sharing.</p><span>How the year runs →</span></a><a class="mcard" href="/method/"><b>9</b><h3>Gates</h3><p>Breathing, attending, making, honoring, connecting, repeating, forgiving, tending, serving.</p><span>How a gate opens →</span></a></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="pricing"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p><h2>A year, not a weekend.</h2></div>
      <div class="offers"><div class="offer feat"><div class="tag">Start here</div><h3>The Keys</h3><div class="price">$149<small>/mo</small></div><p>One key every morning, in order, chamber by chamber, from the 360 and the 180. A live call with Russ each month. Your reflections kept in your own Vault.</p><p class="guarantee">Your first week is on us. $1,490 a year if you’d rather. Cancel any time.</p><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Begin</a></div><div class="offer"><span class="seats">12 seats · begins January 2027</span><div class="tag">With Russ</div><h3>The Coached Year</h3><div class="price">$1,750<small>/mo</small></div><p>Everything in the Keys, plus a private session with Russ every week and a circle of six. Twelve months.</p><p class="guarantee">$19,000 paid in full.</p><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Apply</a></div><div class="offer"><div class="tag">For families</div><h3>The Family Year</h3><div class="price">$3,500<small>/mo</small></div><p>The Coached Year for your household: two to four people, coached together and apart.</p><p class="guarantee">Twelve months. By conversation.</p><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Ask</a></div></div>
      <p class="offers-note">All three are coached by Russ. Buying for a company? Executive and leadership coaching is offered to organizations through <a href="https://triplicityadvisory.com">Triplicity</a>, from $8,500 a month. You never pay for the past, the present or the future. You pay for coaching.</p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="parts"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Learn · Love · Live</p><h2>Your life, in three parts.</h2><p class="lede">Which part is loudest right now? Pick one. Your first key comes from there.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-rail"></div>
      <div class="tl-cards"><a class="tlc brown" href="/as-learned/"><div class="when">The past · Learn</div><h3>As Learned</h3><p>How you were wired. What you were taught. What still runs you.</p><span>Life as learned →</span></a><a class="tlc green" href="/as-loved/"><div class="when">The present · Love</div><h3>As Loved</h3><p>The life you're actually in. Being mindful is the work.</p><span>Life as loved →</span></a><a class="tlc navy" href="/as-lived/"><div class="when">The future · Live</div><h3>As Lived</h3><p>What you'll leave behind. Purpose, legacy, the plan.</p><span>Life as lived →</span></a></div>
      <p class="constant">One coach. One method. <a href="/#pricing">One price to start.</a></p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="faq"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2>Straight answers.</h2></div>
      <div class="faq"><details><summary>What is Vault Human, in one sentence?</summary><p>Daily coaching: one key every morning, a short teaching and one small practice, walked through the year with Russ as your coach.</p></details><details><summary>What are Fretwork, Triplicity and Tercet?</summary><p>Three companies under the same owner that serve organizations, not members: Fretwork automates business systems, Triplicity sells executive and leadership coaching to companies, Tercet Law does wills, trusts and succession. A Vault Human member never needs any of them.</p></details><details><summary>Is Russ really the coach?</summary><p>Yes. A practicing attorney, a twenty-year operator and board president. He chose and ordered every key, leads the monthly calls, and in 2027 personally coaches eighteen people in the Coached Year. Trainers he certifies begin coaching in 2028.</p></details><details><summary>Is this therapy?</summary><p>No. It is coaching. If you need a therapist, we say so.</p></details><details><summary>How much time does it take?</summary><p>About ten minutes a day. The Coached Year adds an hour a week.</p></details><details><summary>What does the first week cost?</summary><p>Nothing. Your first week of keys is on us. If it is not for you, cancel before day eight and you pay nothing.</p></details><details><summary>Can I cancel?</summary><p>Yes. Any time, no fee.</p></details></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec final vid-sec" id="begin"><video class="bgvid" autoplay muted loop playsinline><source src="https://assets.mixkit.co/videos/22728/22728-720.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><div class="veil"></div><div class="wrap">
      <h2>Start tomorrow morning.</h2><p class="lede">Begin tonight, and your first key is in your inbox at 7 a.m.</p>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Begin with Russ</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></div>
    </div></section>
